<%--
Ajax_Entity_Select_Input

A single-type, remote-search entity picker (TomSelect) over
Frontend_Tasks_Controller.search_parents. Options are fetched as the user types
(typeahead), so it scales to large sets (e.g. hundreds of tasks) without loading
them all. Used standalone for the assignee + project fields, and as the entity
half of Parent_Selector_Input.

$parent_type - the search type discriminator ("User_Model" / "Project_Model" /
               "Task_Model" / "Client_Model"). May be changed at runtime via
               set_type() (Parent_Selector_Input swaps it when the type select
               changes).
$exclude_id  - optional; a task id whose subtree is excluded (Task type only,
               cycle guard).
$placeholder - placeholder text.

val() get/set is a scalar entity id (string/number) - timing-indifferent per the
Form_Input_Abstract contract (the base buffers a pre-ready val() and applies it
at _mark_ready). On set of an id not yet in the option set, the specific record's
label is resolved via search_parents({type, id}) so the preselection shows a name.

Renders EMPTY (TomSelect owns the option list) per the inputs contract.
--%>
<Define:Ajax_Entity_Select_Input extends="Select_Input">
    <select $sid="input"></select>
</Define:Ajax_Entity_Select_Input>
